<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's SPIMACO lifts Q1 pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Saudi's SPIMACO lifts Q1 pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	     2.55   vs	0.91</p>
<p> Operating income	  13.50   vs     10.19</p>
<p> Expenses		    12.08   vs	9.43</p>
<p> Net operating income     1.42   vs	0.75</p>
<p> Other income		 1.13   vs	0.16</p>
<p> Assets		   1,604.66   vs  1,573.42</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Pharmaceutical and Medical Appliances Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Amman-based Arab Company for Drug Industries and Medical Appliances owns 20 percent of the firm. The rest is held by Saudi investors.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
